1
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,240
Maybe from the very beginning,

2
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:50,700
I was a mistake that shouldn't have existed.

3
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:54,600
It was sci-fi that gave me the chance to start over again and again.

4
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:55,520
And now,

5
00:01:56,759 --> 00:01:59,720
maybe it's time to end all of this.

6
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,640
Help! Who are you?

7
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:43,079
Let me go!

8
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,720
Let me out!

9
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:53,760
Help!

10
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,480
Is anyone there?

11
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,840
Help me!

12
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:03,560
Zhiwei!

13
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,040
Zhiwei!

14
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:17,400
Zhiwei.

15
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,130
There really is a sixth person.

16
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,440
Mala really came back.

17
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,079
It's okay.

18
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,960
Everything will be over.

19
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,800
Don't worry.

20
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,280
I've already checked.

21
00:03:39,079 --> 00:03:40,360
There's no one here.

22
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:44,760
So what you meant just now is

23
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,960
the starting point of everything tonight.

24
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,260
You accidentally traveled to 12 o'clock

25
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,840
and saw yourself die.

26
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:56,280
So you and Xiaotao

27
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:58,160
were both killed by Ma La.

28
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:01,040
I'm just like Ma La back then,

29
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:03,600
trapped in a time loop.

30
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:07,760
But

31
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:09,920
why would Ma La kill you?

32
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:13,200
I remember seeing the news a long time ago

33
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:18,040
saying Ma La jumped into the sea because of bullying.

34
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,260
Were you involved too?

35
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:28,440
I never bullied or hurt Ma La.

36
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,360
I swear.

37
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,880
What do we do now?

38
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,640
To save Xiaotao

39
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,480
is to save myself.

40
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,320
In real time,

41
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:21,680
I've been trying to save myself for 24 hours.

42
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:29,400
You're back.

43
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:31,970
Wait for me here.

44
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,240
Don't go out alone.

45
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,000
When I finish all this,

46
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,080
we'll leave together.

47
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:38,340
I'm not going with you.

48
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,520
I just came down the mountain

49
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:44,740
and saw a car driving recklessly.

50
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,659
You were there too.

51
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:49,440
Sophie,

52
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:50,520
listen to me.

53
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:52,520
Xiaotao's death wasn't because...

54
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:58,130
How Xiaotao died has nothing to do with me.

55
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:01,640
But you lied to me about Mala for so long.

56
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,600
Dying 10,000 times wouldn't be enough for you.

57
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,440
You killed Mala.

58
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:12,530
And you even dared to write a book about it.

59
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,560
Give me the phone.

60
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:26,260
It doesn't matter.

61
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:28,360
I can go back in time and change everything.

62
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,200
Xiaotao doesn't have to die.

63
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:30,160
And I can live too.

64
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:32,040
But Mala, you will never admit it.

65
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:33,840
He is gone forever.

66
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,720
Li Zhiwei.

67
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,640
You killed him!

68
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:38,840
You ruined him!

69
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,960
I'll hit you!

70
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:40,800
You ruined him!

71
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:41,400
I'll kill you!

72
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:42,730
That's not what I meant.

73
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:50,200
Go to hell!

74
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,000
Go to hell!

75
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:53,640
Sophie!

76
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:57,800
Go to hell!

77
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:58,840
Are you crazy?

78
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:07,040
Why are you hiding a knife under the pillow?

79
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:09,480
You want to kill me.

80
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:11,040
Why is this knife here?

81
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,640
So explain yourself.

82
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,000
Sophie, calm down.

83
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,040
Explain yourself.

84
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:17,880
Make it clear.

85
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:31,680
My face!

86
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:33,000
My face!

87
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,730
I didn't mean it.

88
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:35,920
Li Zhiwei!

89
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,460
You actually tried to kill me!

90
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,680
I didn't mean it, Sophie.

91
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:41,440
Li Zhiwei!

92
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:43,840
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!

93
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:46,560
Li Zhiwei.

94
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:46,960
Don't run!

95
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:47,960
Run! Sophie has gone mad!

96
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,480
Who exactly is the sixth person?

97
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,800
Who killed Mala?

98
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,930
Who killed Xiaotao?

99
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,740
Who is the sixth person today?

100
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:58,200
Li Zhiwei!

101
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:00,680
What's wrong with Sophie?

102
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,920
Why is she like this?

103
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,840
There's no time to explain.

104
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:05,160
We can start over.

105
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,440
None of this will happen.

106
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:08,040
Do as I say. Trust me.

107
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:09,720
Li Zhiwei.

108
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:12,260
Let's think of the same thing.

109
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:15,250
The exact same scene from the past.

110
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:18,880
Li Zhiwei.

111
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,210
I can't do it.

112
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:24,200
All I can think about is Sophie holding a knife.

113
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:26,440
Try again.

114
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:28,370
Think about when we first got here.

115
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:29,840
Hurry up and open the door!

116
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,160
I was playing the piano.

117
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,220
What are you doing?

118
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,580
What's wrong with you?

119
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:38,120
It's nothing. Remember the song you played. Let's try again.

120
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,559
Open the door!

121
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:44,680
Open the door!

122
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:45,480
Open it!
